Source: sparklink
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: SparkLink Maintainers <sparklink@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc (>= 1.85)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://gitee.com/sparklinkZ/sparklink-userspace

Package: sparklink
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus
Description: SparkLink wireless protocol userspace stack
 Complete userspace infrastructure for the SparkLink (星闪) wireless
 communication protocol. Includes the management daemon (slkd),
 command-line tools, and shared library.

Package: libsparklink0
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: SparkLink shared library
 C-compatible shared library (libsparklink.so) providing programmatic
 access to SparkLink hardware through ioctl/chardev interfaces.

Package: libsparklink-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: libsparklink0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: SparkLink development headers
 C header file (sparklink.h) for developing applications against
 libsparklink.
